安全性随访是否均执行生命体征与体格检查、具体采集时点、体格检查系统范围、味觉功能评估是否归入本章。需医学经理结合R5A-PX501非临床安全性数据及访视计划表确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_6ab886818a9603ee","section_number":"7.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4903c727aa5314ffa5680cac","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006070614_a0308c10","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE；味觉障碍发生率与严重程度；实验室；12导联心电图；生命体征","quote_sha256":"0a81d50206b708a8592d23053800dc5b3ef62ff623d25d27d3a88af889b02d94","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"筛选期体格检查、心电图（QTcF>450ms）、实验室检查存在有临床意义异常","quote_sha256":"625f7ac6e56e835880f7ce505f4f90b543bde06135d2a3191e01a5fb1fe21d1c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"es_exclusion_criteria"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"筛选访视（第-28~-1天：两次24h咳嗽监测、辣椒素激发、肺功能与影像复核、实验室、心电图）","quote_sha256":"6c35f911f7cf57fec40e1fa2f145efe03b519e18594b5cbb25afd835aa2c75d6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"es_visit_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"靶点/作用机制：P2X3受体拮抗（高选择性P2X3:P2X2/3选择性>100倍）","quote_sha256":"74174d2ab1dfe5318c3f766cce6d4e0717304b313496d991702942c0956d0694","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"es_drug_mechanism"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"治疗访视：W2、W4、W8（W